From e61aa4517e9202d592ae5f0d39bf6ec64724ad0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lazybrar <211365301+lazybrar@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 17:20:52 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] firmware: qcom: scm: allow QSEECOM on the OnePlus Nord
 (avicii)

The QSEECOM version query succeeds on the OnePlus Nord (SM7250), which
reports version 0x1402000, but the interface is skipped as an untested
machine. The app lookup and app send calls use the same SMC IDs as on the
already allowed machines, so add it to the allowlist.

Signed-off-by: lazybrar <211365301+lazybrar@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
index 85971853684d..736f0ca5479d 100644
--- a/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
+++ b/drivers/firmware/qcom/qcom_scm.c
@@ -2398,6 +2398,7 @@ static const struct of_device_id qcom_scm_qseecom_allowlist[] __maybe_unused = {
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,denali", },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus13", },
 	{ .compatible = "microsoft,romulus15", },
+	{ .compatible = "oneplus,avicii" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,glymur-crd" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,hamoa-iot-evk" },
 	{ .compatible = "qcom,mahua-crd" },
-- 
